The `Before` hook only clears `sharedLocalStorage`, not `this._capturedElements`. So when a scenario captures elements, that array persists into subsequent scenarios, which is why the persistence and routing scenarios are failing—they're seeing leftover captured elements from earlier tests.

The real issue is that `_capturedElements` isn't being reset between scenarios, so I need to add cleanup logic to the `Before` hook to clear it before each test runs.

